    aat:raw """[#appeasement.section, year=1938, type=diplomatic, region=英法]
== 绥靖政策

英法对纳粹德国的妥协政策。
慕尼黑协定出卖捷克斯洛伐克。
绥靖未能阻止战争，反而助长了
xref:闪击波兰[闪击波兰, rel=emboldens, weight=0.6]。

""";
    aat:region "英法";
    aat:relativePath "document.adoc";
    aat:role "section";
    aat:startLine 32;
    aat:type "diplomatic";
    aat:year "1938";
    rel:emboldens <urn:aat:doc:cb2326f19571d90604fdc849e1feae1baf446791ecbd64bcba2520c45cc0c1be#heading-l40-o0>.
